  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Good Shepherd and His Sheep",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Very truly I tell you Pharisees, anyone who does not enter the sheep pen by the gate, but climbs in by some other way, is a thief and a robber.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The one who enters by the gate is the shepherd of the sheep.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The gatekeeper opens the gate for him, and the sheep listen to his voice. He calls his own sheep by name and leads them out.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "When he has brought out all his own, he goes on ahead of them, and his sheep follow him because they know his voice.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "But they will never follow a stranger; in fact, they will run away from him because they do not recognize a stranger's voice.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus used this figure of speech, but the Pharisees did not understand what he was telling them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore Jesus said again,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Very truly I tell you, I am the gate for the sheep.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "All who have come before me are thieves and robbers, but the sheep have not listened to them.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "I am the gate; whoever enters through me will be saved.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "They will come in and go out, and find pasture.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The thief comes only to steal and kill and destroy; I have come that they may have life, and have it to the full.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"I am the good shepherd. The good shepherd lays down his life for the sheep.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The hired hand is not the shepherd and does not own the sheep. So when he sees the wolf coming, he abandons the sheep and runs away. Then the wolf attacks the flock and scatters it.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The man runs away because he is a hired hand and cares nothing for the sheep.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"I am the good shepherd; I know my sheep and my sheep know me—",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "just as the Father knows me and I know the Father—and I lay down my life for the sheep.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "I have other sheep that are not of this sheep pen. I must bring them also. They too will listen to my voice, and there shall be one flock and one shepherd.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The reason my Father loves me is that I lay down my life—only to take it up again.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "No one takes it from me, but I lay it down of my own accord. I have authority to lay it down and authority to take it up again. This command I received from my Father.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Jews who heard these words were again divided.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many of them said, \"He is demon-possessed and raving mad. Why listen to him?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But others said, \"These are not the sayings of a man possessed by a demon. Can a demon open the eyes of the blind?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Further Conflict Over Jesus' Claims",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then came the Festival of Dedication",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "at Jerusalem. It was winter,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Jesus was in the temple courts walking in Solomon's Colonnade.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Jews who were there gathered around him, saying, \"How long will you keep us in suspense? If you are the Messiah, tell us plainly.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"I did tell you, but you do not believe. The works I do in my Father's name testify about me,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but you do not believe because you are not my sheep.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "My sheep listen to my voice; I know them, and they follow me.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "I give them eternal life, and they shall never perish; no one will snatch them out of my hand.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "My Father, who has given them to me, is greater than all",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "; no one can snatch them out of my Father's hand.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "I and the Father are one.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Again his Jewish opponents picked up stones to stone him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but Jesus said to them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"I have shown you many good works from the Father. For which of these do you stone me?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"We are not stoning you for any good work,\" they replied, \"but for blasphemy, because you, a mere man, claim to be God.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Is it not written in your Law, 'I have said you are \"gods\" '",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "?",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "If he called them 'gods,' to whom the word of God came—and Scripture cannot be set aside—",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "what about the one whom the Father set apart as his very own and sent into the world? Why then do you accuse me of blasphemy because I said, 'I am God's Son'?",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.36",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.36"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Do not believe me unless I do the works of my Father.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.37",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.37"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "But if I do them, even though you do not believe me, believe the works, that you may know and understand that the Father is in me, and I in the Father.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.10.38",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.10.38"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Again they tried to seize him, but he escaped their grasp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus went back across the Jordan to the place where John had been baptizing in the early days. There he stayed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and many people came to him. They said, \"Though John never performed a sign, all that John said about this man was true.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in that place many believed in Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.10.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
